item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10,000 - 25,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.8<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">August 1, 2006<br/>Summer Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20060828180543&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Flask_of_Warrior_s_Sweat_61fe73.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a flask of warrior's sweat.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 3.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">It contains the sweat spilled in many battles and is said to be used for certain perfumes too.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Looks the same as a Brown Flask or a <a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20of%20Cough%20Syrup\">Cough Syrup</a> flask. Although it's a liquid, it cannot be drank or spilled on the ground.\n<br/>\n</p><p>4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Warrior%20Helmet\">Warrior Helmets</a> can be exchanged for this item with <a href=\"#/wiki/Haroun\">Haroun</a> (<a href=\"#/wiki/Ashta%27daramai\">Blue Djinn Fortress</a>) or <a href=\"#/wiki/Yaman\">Yaman</a> (<a href=\"#/wiki/Mal%27ouquah\">Green Djinn Fortress</a>). <br/>\nNeeded for <a href=\"#/quest/assassin-outfits-quest\">Assassin Outfits Quest</a>, <a href=\"#/quest/barbarian-outfits-quest\">Barbarian Outfits Quest</a> and <a href=\"#/quest/knight-outfits-quest\">Knight Outfits Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Duke%20Krule\">Duke Krule</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/King%20Zelos\">King Zelos</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Enraged%20Thorn%20Knight\">The Enraged Thorn Knight</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Undead%20Elite%20Gladiator\">Undead Elite Gladiator</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Undead%20Gladiator\">Undead Gladiator</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ushuriel\">Ushuriel</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buyfrom\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Haroun\">Haroun</a><sup>3, 2</sup></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Ashta%27daramai\">Ashta'daramai</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Warrior%20Helmet\">Warrior Helmets</a></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Yaman\">Yaman</a><sup>1, 2</sup></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Mal%27ouquah\">Mal'ouquah</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Warrior%20Helmet\">Warrior Helmets</a></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"item-notes\"><b>Notes:</b><ol><li id=\"w-notes-1\">Only if <a href=\"#/quest/the-djinn-war-efreet-faction\">friendly with the green djinns</a>.</li><li id=\"w-notes-2\">By saying <i>(sell/buy) item name</i>.</li><li id=\"w-notes-3\">Only if <a href=\"#/quest/the-djinn-war-marid-faction\">friendly with the blue djinns</a>.</li></ol></div></div>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-sellto\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Fiona\">Fiona</a></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">10,000 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Yasir\">Yasir</a></td><td>Varies</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">10,000 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Archdemons</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/assassin-outfits-quest\">Assassin Outfits Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Belongings%20of%20a%20Deceased\">Belongings of a Deceased</a></li><li>Bosses</li><li>Brown Flask</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Creature%20Products\">Creature Products</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Duke%20Krule\">Duke Krule</a></li><li>Duplicate Sprites</li><li>Enchanted Items</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fiona\">Fiona</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Haroun\">Haroun</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Invisibility\">Invisibility</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/King%20Zelos\">King Zelos</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/knight-outfits-quest\">Knight Outfits Quest</a></li><li>Shops</li><li>Skeletons</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Enraged%20Thorn%20Knight\">The Enraged Thorn Knight</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Ruthless%20Seven%20Minions\">The Ruthless Seven Minions</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Undead%20Elite%20Gladiator\">Undead Elite Gladiator</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Undead%20Gladiator\">Undead Gladiator</a></li><li>Undead Humanoids</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ushuriel\">Ushuriel</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Warrior%20Helmet\">Warrior Helmet</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Yaman\">Yaman</a></li><li><a href